The state guidance calls for exhaustive `when` expressions, which fits this domain well. I’m implementing cancellation under the order repository’s shared lifecycle lock; shipment creation uses that same lock, preventing a cancelled order from gaining a shipment during the transition and preserving the all-or-nothing rule.
